{"author_original": "westurner", "user_id": "user_0559", "text": "The Python installation tool utilized to install different versions of Anaconda and component packages is called [conda](<a href=\"http://docs.continuum.io/conda/intro.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">http:&#x2F;&#x2F;docs.continuum.io&#x2F;conda&#x2F;intro.html</a>). [pythonbrew]( <a href=\"https://github.com/utahta/pythonbrew\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;utahta&#x2F;pythonbrew</a>) in combination with [virtualenvwrapper](<a href=\"http://virtualenvwrapper.readthedocs.org/en/latest/\" rel=\"nofollow\">http:&#x2F;&#x2F;virtualenvwrapper.readthedocs.org&#x2F;en&#x2F;latest&#x2F;</a>) is also great.", "timestamp": "2013-06-30T07:16:11+00:00", "unix_time": 1372576571, "id": 5964997, "parent": 5964538}
{"author_original": "westurner", "user_id": "user_0559", "text": "<a href=\"https://github.com/devstructure/blueprint\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;devstructure&#x2F;blueprint</a> [generates] configuration sets for &quot;Puppet or Chef or CFEngine 3.&quot;<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Comparison_of_open-source_configuration_management_software\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;en.wikipedia.org&#x2F;wiki&#x2F;Comparison_of_open-source_conf...</a><p><a href=\"https://ops-school.readthedocs.org/en/latest/config_management.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;ops-school.readthedocs.org&#x2F;en&#x2F;latest&#x2F;config_manageme...</a>", "timestamp": "2013-07-04T03:20:40+00:00", "unix_time": 1372908040, "id": 5989012, "parent": 5984462}
{"author_original": "westurner", "user_id": "user_0559", "text": "The Green Tea Press books are great; and free.<p>Think Python: How To Think Like a Computer Scientist <a href=\"http://www.greenteapress.com/thinkpython/thinkpython.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">http:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.greenteapress.com&#x2F;thinkpython&#x2F;thinkpython.html</a><p>Think Complexity: Exploring Complexity Science with Python : <a href=\"http://www.greenteapress.com/compmod/\" rel=\"nofollow\">http:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.greenteapress.com&#x2F;compmod&#x2F;</a><p>Think Stats: Probability and Statistics for Programmers : <a href=\"http://www.greenteapress.com/thinkstats/index.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">http:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.greenteapress.com&#x2F;thinkstats&#x2F;index.html</a>", "timestamp": "2013-07-07T01:47:13+00:00", "unix_time": 1373161633, "id": 6000728, "parent": 6000043}
{"author_original": "westurner", "user_id": "user_0559", "text": "You can search announced, in progress, future, self-paced, and finished MOOCs (Massive Open Online Courses) with class-central.com : <a href=\"http://www.class-central.com/search?q=python\" rel=\"nofollow\">http:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.class-central.com&#x2F;search?q=python</a>", "timestamp": "2013-07-07T01:50:07+00:00", "unix_time": 1373161807, "id": 6000732, "parent": 5998911}
{"author_original": "westurner", "user_id": "user_0559", "text": "Here are three resources for learning Python for Science :<p><a href=\"http://scipy-lectures.github.io\" rel=\"nofollow\">http:&#x2F;&#x2F;scipy-lectures.github.io</a><p><a href=\"https://github.com/jrjohansson/scientific-python-lectures\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;jrjohansson&#x2F;scientific-python-lectures</a><p><a href=\"https://github.com/ipython/ipython/wiki/A-gallery-of-interesting-IPython-Notebooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;ipython&#x2F;ipython&#x2F;wiki&#x2F;A-gallery-of-interes...</a>", "timestamp": "2013-07-07T01:54:52+00:00", "unix_time": 1373162092, "id": 6000743, "parent": 5998750}
